[{"id":"app-testing-state-assertion","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["Appium","断言"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言","articlePath":"posts/2f02a034/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言","articlePath":"posts/2f02a034/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么只断言元素存在不能证明业务成功？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>元素存在只说明局部画面出现，业务状态可能未提交、数据错误或页面显示旧缓存。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>从用户目标定义断言：页面转移、结果文案、业务数据和系统状态至少选择一项能区分成功与失败的证据，再用元素和日志辅助归因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-008","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["FDB","故障排查"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>FDB 条目老化或主机换端口时，可能出现什么现象？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>第一次通信可能经历未知单播泛洪或短暂延迟，随后交换机重新学习位置。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>应结合端口、MAC、广播域和抓包证据判断；不要因为一次泛洪就清空所有网络状态。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>观察交换机时，先区分“学习”与“转发”两个动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>输入\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>交换机动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>观察结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>源 MAC 从端口 1 进入\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录 MAC → 端口 1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>FDB 新增或刷新\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 已在端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查询 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只发往端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 未知\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>暂时无法定向\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同广播域泛洪且不回入端口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此主机换端口或条目老化时，短暂泛洪是动态学习的结果；要判断故障，还要看端口、VLAN 和后续是否重新学习。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-parameter-source","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["参数","请求解析"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Path、Query、Header、Cookie 与 Body 如何判定来源？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>路径模板中的同名参数进入 Path；显式声明的 Query/Header/Cookie 从对应协议位置读取；Pydantic 模型参数默认读取 JSON Body。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>FastAPI 先根据路径模板完成路由匹配，再依据参数类型和 \u003ccode>Path\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Query\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Header\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Cookie\u003c/code> 等标记建立提取规则。规则会同时生成 OpenAPI 的 \u003ccode>in\u003c/code> 字段和 422 的 \u003ccode>loc\u003c/code>，所以来源不是运行时猜测。遇到同名值时，先看签名中的显式标记和路径模板，再看 Schema，不要靠请求示例反推。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-background-task-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["后台任务","队列"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候应该使用 \u003ccode>BackgroundTasks\u003c/code>，什么时候升级到持久队列？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>短小、同进程、失败可记录的任务适合 \u003ccode>BackgroundTasks\u003c/code>；需要重试、跨进程、长时间运行或可靠投递时使用持久队列。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>BackgroundTasks\u003c/code> 在响应后由当前进程执行，进程崩溃或重启会丢失任务。持久队列把任务状态和重试交给独立系统，API 只返回任务 ID。无论哪种方案，都要设计幂等键、状态机和关闭行为，不能把“响应已经返回”当作任务一定成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-linux-distro","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["系统组成","发行版"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Linux 内核、发行版、终端和 Shell 分别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>内核管理硬件与资源；发行版组合内核和用户空间；终端负责字符输入输出；Shell 解释并执行命令。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>可以把一次环境识别拆成四个观测点：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观测点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>命令\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>看到的对象\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>内核\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>uname -srm\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>正在运行的内核与架构\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>发行版\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>cat /etc/os-release\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>用户空间发行版标识\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Shell\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>printf &#39;%s\\n&#39; &quot;$0&quot;\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前解释器入口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>命令解析\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>type -a ls\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>别名、内建或外部文件\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这四个结果可能来自不同层，不能用一个版本号代替整台机器的结论。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-oop-new-init","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","__new__","__init__","对象生命周期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(七)面向对象与数据模型.md","articleTitle":"Python(七)面向对象与数据模型","articlePath":"posts/1aeb52d0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(七)面向对象与数据模型.md","articleTitle":"Python(七)面向对象与数据模型","articlePath":"posts/1aeb52d0/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>__new__\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>__init__\u003c/code> 的职责分别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>__new__\u003c/code> 创建并返回实例，\u003ccode>__init__\u003c/code> 对已经创建的实例初始化状态。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>实例创建和初始化是两个阶段：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">User\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">__new__\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">cls, name\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        instance = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">super\u003c/span>().__new__(cls)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 创建实例\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> instance\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">__init__\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self, name\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.name = name                 \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 初始化已创建实例\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>普通可变类只需实现 \u003ccode>__init__\u003c/code>。继承不可变类型、控制实例缓存或做元编程时才考虑 \u003ccode>__new__\u003c/code>；它必须返回实例（或子类实例），而 \u003ccode>__init__\u003c/code> 只负责初始化并且必须返回 \u003ccode>None\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-iteration-decorator-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","装饰器","wraps","调用顺序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>两个装饰器 \u003ccode>@outer\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>@inner\u003c/code> 的应用顺序是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>等价于 \u003ccode>func = outer(inner(func))\u003c/code>，inner 先包住原函数，outer 再包住结果。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>装饰器在定义阶段从下往上应用，调用时却从外往内执行：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@outer\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@inner\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">work\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;ok&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 等价于 work = outer(inner(work))\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此 \u003ccode>inner\u003c/code> 先包住原函数，\u003ccode>outer\u003c/code> 再包住 inner 的结果。包装器应使用 \u003ccode>functools.wraps\u003c/code> 保留元数据，并明确透传参数、返回值和异常；若包裹 async 函数，还要保持 \u003ccode>async def\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>await\u003c/code> 的调用模型。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]